Hint





Weight by \(u_j\): the outlet collects what flows, \(\sum_{y_j &gt; w/2} u_j c_j \big/ \sum_j u_j c_j(0)\). March from one distance to the next, not from 0 each time. Python: np.flatnonzero for the first index; R: which.









